.340" end="00:20.670">some </span><span begin="00:20.670" end="00:21.120">things </span><span begin="00:21.120" end="00:21.240">I </span><span begin="00:21.240" end="00:21.540">won't </span><span begin="00:21.540" end="00:22.140">do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.380" end="00:23.580"><span begin="00:22.380" end="00:22.560">And </span><span begin="00:22.560" end="00:22.650">I'm </span><span begin="00:22.650" end="00:22.860">not </span><span begin="00:22.860" end="00:23.130">afraid </span><span begin="00:23.130" end="00:23.220">to </span><span begin="00:23.220" end="00:23.430">tell </span><span begin="00:23.430" end="00:23.580">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.580" end="00:26.850"><span begin="00:23.580" end="00:23.700">I </span><span begin="00:23.700" end="00:23.850">don't </span><span begin="00:23.850" end="00:24.090">ever </span><span begin="00:24.090" end="00:24.270">want </span><span begin="00:24.270" end="00:24.330">to </span><span begin="00:24.330" end="00:24.690">leave </span><span begin="00:24.690" end="00:24.780">you </span><span begin="00:24.780" end="00:26.850">confused</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.880" end="00:28.740"><span begin="00:26.880" end="00:27.090">The </span><span begin="00:27.090" end="00:27.750">more </span><span begin="00:27.750" end="00:28.230">you </span><span begin="00:28.230" end="00:28.740">try</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.890" end="00:31.140"><span begin="00:28.890" end="00:29.460">The </span><span begin="00:29.460" end="00:30.060">less </span><span begin="00:30.060" end="00:30.570">I </span><span begin="00:30.570" end="00:30.930">buy </span><span begin="00:30.930" end="00:31.140">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.200" end="00:33.720"><span begin="00:31.200" end="00:31.710">And </span><span begin="00:31.710" end="00:31.920">I </span><span begin="00:31.920" end="00:32.220">don't </span><span begin="00:32.220" end="00:32.400">have </span><span begin="00:32.400" end="00:32.640">to </span><span begin="00:32.640" end="00:33.060">think </span><span begin="00:33.060" end="00:33.180">it </span><span begin="00:33.180" end="00:33.720">through</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.900" end="00:36.480"><span begin="00:33.900" end="00:34.170">You </span><span begin="00:34.170" end="00:34.470">know </span><span begin="00:34.470" end="00:34.770">if </span><span begin="00:34.770" end="00:35.040">I'm </span><span begin="00:35.040" end="00:35.400">into </span><span begin="00:35.400" end="00:36.480">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.690" end="00:39.360"><span begin="00:36.690" end="00:37.020">I </span><span begin="00:37.020" end="00:37.110">don't </span><span begin="00:37.110" end="00:37.320">need </span><span begin="00:37.320" end="00:37.380">a </span><span begin="00:37.380" end="00:37.800">man </span><span begin="00:37.800" end="00:37.860">to </span><span begin="00:37.860" end="00:38.250">make </span><span begin="00:38.250" end="00:38.400">it </span><span begin="00:38.400" end="00:39.360">happen</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.390" end="00:41.130"><span begin="00:39.390" end="00:39.630">I </span><span begin="00:39.630" end="00:39.930">get </span><span begin="00:39.930" end="00:40.110">off </span><span begin="00:40.110" end="00:40.650">being </span><span begin="00:40.650" end="00:41.130">free</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.520" end="00:43.830"><span begin="00:41.520" end="00:41.751">I </span><span begin="00:41.751" end="00:41.982">don't </span><span begin="00:41.982" end="00:42.213">need </span><span begin="00:42.213" end="00:42.444">a </span><span begin="00:42.444" end="00:42.675">man </span><span begin="00:42.675" end="00:42.906">to </span><span begin="00:42.906" end="00:43.137">make </span><span begin="00:43.137" end="00:43.368">me </span><span begin="00:43.368" end="00:43.599">feel </span><span begin="00:43.599" end="00:43.830">good</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.860" end="00:45.660"><span begin="00:43.860" end="00:44.130">I </span><span begin="00:44.130" end="00:44.430">get </span><span begin="00:44.430" end="00:44.640">off </span><span begin="00:44.640" end="00:44.910">doing </span><span begin="00:44.910" end="00:45.150">my </span><span begin="00:45.150" end="00:45.660">thing</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.720" end="00:48.390"><span begin="00:45.720" end="00:46.080">I </span><span begin="00:46.080" end="00:46.200">don't </span><span begin="00:46.200" end="00:46.380">need </span><span begin="00:46.380" end="00:46.470">a </span><span begin="00:46.470" end="00:47.010">ring </span><span begin="00:47.010" end="00:47.190">around </span><span begin="00:47.190" end="00:47.430">my </span><span begin="00:47.430" end="00:48.390">finger</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.420" end="00:50.190"><span begin="00:48.420" end="00:48.660">To </span><span begin="00:48.660" end="00:48.960">make </span><span begin="00:48.960" end="00:49.110">me </span><span begin="00:49.110" end="00:49.410">feel </span><span begin="00:49.410" end="00:50.190">complete</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.190" end="00:51.690"><span begin="00:50.190" end="00:50.340">So </span><span begin="00:50.340" end="00:50.580">let </span><span begin="00:50.580" end="00:50.730">me </span><span begin="00:50.730" end="00:51.120">break </span><span begin="00:51.120" end="00:51.210">it </span><span begin="00:51.210" end="00:51.690">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.750" end="00:53.910"><span begin="00:51.750" end="00:51.870">I </span><span begin="00:51.870" end="00:52.020">can </span><span begin="00:52.020" end="00:52.230">get </span><span begin="00:52.230" end="00:52.470">off </span><span begin="00:52.470" end="00:52.590">when </span><span begin="00:52.590" end="00:52.980">you </span><span begin="00:52.980" end="00:53.340">ain't </span><span begin="00:53.340" end="00:53.910">around</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.260" end="01:03.090"><span begin="00:55.260" end="00:56.460">Oh</span><span be