">a </span><span begin="01:12.510" end="01:12.870">love </span><span begin="01:12.870" end="01:13.290">that's </span><span begin="01:13.290" end="01:13.740">for </span><span begin="01:13.740" end="01:14.310">real</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.520" end="01:16.620"><span begin="01:14.520" end="01:14.700">And </span><span begin="01:14.700" end="01:15.120">without </span><span begin="01:15.120" end="01:15.540">that </span><span begin="01:15.540" end="01:15.690">then </span><span begin="01:15.690" end="01:15.900">no </span><span begin="01:15.900" end="01:16.620">deal</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.710" end="01:18.060"><span begin="01:16.710" end="01:16.800">And </span><span begin="01:16.800" end="01:17.130">baby </span><span begin="01:17.130" end="01:17.280">I </span><span begin="01:17.280" end="01:17.400">don't </span><span begin="01:17.400" end="01:17.610">need </span><span begin="01:17.610" end="01:17.670">a </span><span begin="01:17.670" end="01:18.060">hand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.060" end="01:21.000"><span begin="01:18.060" end="01:18.150">If </span><span begin="01:18.150" end="01:18.300">it </span><span begin="01:18.300" end="01:18.540">only </span><span begin="01:18.540" end="01:18.720">wants </span><span begin="01:18.720" end="01:18.780">to </span><span begin="01:18.780" end="01:19.260">grab </span><span begin="01:19.260" end="01:19.470">one </span><span begin="01:19.470" end="01:21.000">thing</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.330" end="01:23.220"><span begin="01:21.330" end="01:21.510">The </span><span begin="01:21.510" end="01:22.170">more </span><span begin="01:22.170" end="01:22.620">you </span><span begin="01:22.620" end="01:23.220">try</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.250" end="01:25.560"><span begin="01:23.250" end="01:23.880">The </span><span begin="01:23.880" end="01:24.420">less </span><span begin="01:24.420" end="01:24.930">I </span><span begin="01:24.930" end="01:25.350">buy </span><span begin="01: